Slackware    \       
source on:    \      IDE                 SCSI             MFM
--------------+------------------+------------------+-------------------------
Floppy:       | bare             | scsi             | xt
              | * old1118        | * old1118        |
              |                  | * alpha          |
              |                  | * loaded         |
--------------+------------------+------------------+-------------------------
